d MAHA from day one", "last_comment_created": 1795040410258, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 7, "score_up": 48, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2123099571383402896", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToiNA12G", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 21, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "reeee", "id": 8945570, "raw_content": "", "author": "DingleBalls", "created": 1795036656756, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Addicted2Clickbait", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToiNA12G.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/townhallcom/status/2123099571383402896", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "REEEEECLAIMING MAH TIME!", "last_comment_created": 1795045072673, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 6, "score_up": 21, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 272, "created": 1795021357000, "id": "2123099571383402896", "video": {"preview": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2123098468117823488/img/9jr0h7Q26873jWzQ.jpg", "mpeg": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2123098468117823488/pl/Ru9NfkO3nej4wO0_.m3u8?v=77d", "aspectRatio": [360, 203], "heightRatio": 56, "type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2123098468117823488/vid/avc1/478x270/lN0h65Fr3UeQMWFj.mp4"}, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1646204237859242006/zbZik6FX_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Townhall.com", "username": "townhallcom"}, "content": "\ud83d\udea8LaMonica McIver did NOT like the facts DHS Secretary Mullin was dropping, so she kept reclaiming her time to SILENCE him\n\nMcIver: \"I'll ask you again, have you taken the time to visit Delaney Hall, a detention center that is under your umbrella? \n\nMullin: \"Absolutely, I have.", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 1814}}, "post_flair_text": "\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0REEEEEEE!\u00a0", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToiNA0hi", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 24, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8945526, "raw_content": "Christians are often asked, \u201cIf God is so loving, why would He send anyone to Hell?\u201d\n\nBut a reading of this two-part item clearly demonstrates that it is not so much that God sends people to Hell.  We send ourselves to Hell when there is a rejection of His call to repentance, and of His love, mercy, and grace that becomes so persistent that He finally confirms us in our rebellion and rejection of Him and that is what leads the persistently unrepentant soul into damnation.\n\nIf there is going to be a persistent rejection of the call to repentance and of the love of God in this life, why would there be any acceptance of it in Heaven?  If we do not seek reconciliation with our Creator from whom our sin separates us now in this present life, why would we in the after life?\n\nIf we refuse to have anything to do with God in this present life, He is just simply giving us what we want when we are cast into Hell as a consequence; an eternity separated from His love which means that in Hell, there is no love at all, no mercy, no grace, no happiness, no joy, no comfort, and no peace, but only an unrelenting eternity of torment beyond imagination because in Hell, we are completely cut off from the very source of the love, peace, joy, happiness, and contentment that we seek.\n\nhttps://www.theinevitabletruth.com/p/when-god-stops-calling-the-terrifying\n\nhttps://www.theinevitabletruth.com/p/can-god-stop-offering-you-salvation\n", "author": "ContendersEdge", "created": 1795033719452, "profile_picture": "OTUZVRkFHNZn", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "ContendersEdge", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Christians are often asked, \u201cIf God is so loving, why would He send anyone to Hell?\u201d\n", "last_comment_created": 1795050586351, "content": "<p>Christians are often asked, \u201cIf God is so loving, why would He send anyone to Hell?\u201d</p>\n<p>But a reading of this two-part item clearly demonstrates that it is not so much that God sends people to Hell.  We send ourselves to Hell when there is a rejection of His call to repentance, and of His love, mercy, and grace that becomes so persistent that He finally confirms us in our rebellion and rejection of Him and that is what leads the persistently unrepentant soul into damnation.</p>\n<p>If there is going to be a persistent rejection of the call to repentance and of the love of God in this life, why would there be any acceptance of it in Heaven?  If we do not seek reconciliation with our Creator from whom our sin separates us now in this present life, why would we in the after life?</p>\n<p>If we refuse to have anything to do with God in this present life, He is just simply giving us what we want when we are cast into Hell as a consequence; an eternity separated from His love which means that in Hell, there is no love at all, no mercy, no grace, no happiness, no joy, no comfort, and no peace, but only an unrelenting eternity of torment beyond imagination because in Hell, we are completely cut off from the very source of the love, peace, joy, happiness, and contentment that we seek.</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.theinevitabletruth.com/p/when-god-stops-calling-the-terrifying\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.theinevitabletruth.com/p/when-god-stops-calling-the-terrifying</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.theinevitabletruth.com/p/can-god-stop-offering-you-salvation\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.theinevitabletruth.com/p/can-god-stop-offering-you-salvation</a></p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 17, "score_up": 24, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToiN8uq9", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 60, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8945171, "raw_content": "", "author": "YugYensid", "created": 1795015724677, "profile_picture": "oiw6uZ22ifWj", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "PresidentRubio2028", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToiN8uq9.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/rC35RCS2inHD.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/qX0yve99RxvMsN8u.jpeg", "width": 759, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 768}], "blurhash": "U3Qcn}00^+-p00=|_NX900.89F-:00_